WEBVTT

00:14:29.207 --> 00:14:31.287
Can you feel the rage?

00:14:31.311 --> 00:14:33.693
Can you feel that you just want
to take these guys

00:14:33.717 --> 00:14:35.167
and wring their necks?

00:14:35.191 --> 00:14:36.441
Can you go there?

00:14:37.335 --> 00:14:39.010
It shouldn't be that difficult.

00:14:39.389 --> 00:14:42.338
You just -- oh, man.

00:14:43.274 --> 00:14:48.445
Now, put yourself in their shoes.

00:14:50.771 --> 00:14:52.748
Are they brutal killers

00:14:52.772 --> 00:14:54.725
or patriotic defenders?

00:14:56.701 --> 00:14:57.854
Which one?

00:14:58.491 --> 00:15:01.676
Can you feel their anger,